# Profile: general

Steward's general profile (ADR-0018): the whole harness as it was before profiles, so it
cuts nothing. Every task starts here; narrower profiles take their task families from it.
Its tools are every tool Steward's build offers; its read budget is the explore step's 8;
medium is the model's own default reasoning effort.

The bound ids are the board's (see `../board.us`). Steward's own file calls the
read-only-channel bound `whatsapp`; a portable declaration names the rule, not the app.

```json
